# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ignore policy
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo is plain Markdown/text, so almost nothing should be ignored yet.
# The rules below keep OS, editor, and scratch noise out of history now, and
# cover common tooling in case a site/build pipeline is added later.

# --- OS junk ---
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
*.lnk

# --- Editor / IDE ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
*.code-workspace

# --- Temp / scratch files ---
*.tmp
*.temp
.tmp-*
*~
# Throwaway analysis scripts: agents and contributors write these next to the
# content to measure it. They are working notes, never deliverables, and
# `git add -A` has already swept one into a commit once. Anchored to the repo
# root on purpose, so a real `_`-prefixed file inside a package is unaffected.
/_*.mjs
/_*.js
/_*.md
/_*.txt
/tmp-*
/scripts/tmp-*

# --- Logs ---
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- Node (if tooling is added later) ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.cache/
.npm/
.pnpm-store/

# --- Python (if scripting is added later) ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# --- Secrets / local environment ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local